5094723\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Boing boing.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c8/Boing_boing..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210125094723\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c8/Boing_boing..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210125094723 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c8/Boing_boing..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210125094723 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Boing boing.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Boing_boing..png\" data-image-name=\"Boing boing..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">5</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\">Bob Mortimer</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spoony_Neeson.\" title=\"Spoony Neeson.\">Spoony Neeson.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Their_water%27s_so_delicious.\" title=\"Their water&#39;s so delicious.\">Their water's so delicious.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Boing boing.</b></i> is the seventh episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">Series 5</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 25 October 2017. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\">Bob Mortimer</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Boing_boing.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Boing boing\" was a phrase uttered several times in a French accent by <a href=\"/wiki/Sally_Phillips\" title=\"Sally Phillips\">Sally Phillips</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_funny_little_flick-book_film\" title=\"Make a funny little flick-book film\">Make a funny little flick-book film</a> task. The title card shows a cheese grater and some grated bread, referencing the bread crumbs contestants left in the <a href=\"/wiki/Wearing_that_blindfold_at_all_times,_travel_as_far_as_possible_in_three_minutes\" title=\"Wearing that blindfold at all times, travel as far as possible in three minutes\">Wearing that blindfold at all times, travel as far as possible in three minutes</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Boing_boing.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Poing poing', which translates as 'Boing boing'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Boing_boing.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Aisling_Bea\" title=\"Aisling Bea\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Aisling Bea</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Bob Mortimer</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mark_Watson\" title=\"Mark Watson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mark Watson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Nish_Kumar\" title=\"Nish Kumar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Nish Kumar</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sally_Phillips\" title=\"Sally Phillips\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sally Phillips</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_surprisingly_expensive_item\" title=\"Most surprisingly expensive item\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most surprisingly expensive item.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Wearing_that_blindfold_at_all_times,_travel_as_far_as_possible_in_three_minutes\" title=\"Wearing that blindfold at all times, travel as far as possible in three minutes\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Wearing that blindfold at all times, travel as far as possible in three minutes. Alex will be at your side at all times because he is a strong, independent, handsome man. On removing the blindfold, you will then have another three minutes to retrace your steps to your starting position.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Muster_the_biggest_coconut_bobsleigh_team\" title=\"Muster the biggest coconut bobsleigh team\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Muster the biggest coconut bobsleigh team. You may only use items from the caravan to secure your coconuts. You'll be disqualified if you use any item used by another contestant.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Vote_for_which_contestant_you_think_should_receive_five_bonus_points\" title=\"Vote for which contestant you think should receive five bonus points\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Vote for which contestant you think should receive five bonus points. The contestant who receives the most votes will receive five bonus points. You may vote for yourself. If, however, you vote for yourself and fail to receive the most votes, you will lose two points.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>-2\n</td>\n<td>-2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_funny_little_flick-book_film\" title=\"Make a funny little flick-book film\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make a funny little flick-book film. The mat beneath your feet is the paper. The camera above your head will take photos of your paper.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Send_the_most_things_to_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Send the most things to the Taskmaster\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Send the most things to the Taskmaster. Items must travel via zipline and land on your segment of the Taskmaster's table. You may not move from your current position.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>18</b>\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Boing_boing.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_5,_Episode_7_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Boing_Boing%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/50/Taskmaster_-_Series_5%2C_Episode_7_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Boing_Boing%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003919\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_5,_Episode_7_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Boing_Boing&#39;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_5,_Episode_7_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Boing_Boing&#39;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 5, Episode 7 - Full Episode - &#39;Boing Boing&#39;\" class=\"\" /> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t<svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\" aria-label=\"Play\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg>\t</span> </a> <figcaption></figcaption></figure><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Boing_boing.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/boing-boing\"><i>Boing boing.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/71674-007\"><i>Boing boing.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141450\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.127 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 45